      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Douglas%2C_North_Dakota",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town is named after Douglas Creek, which honored Major Douglas stationed at Fort Stevenson in the 1870s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
