      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.douglasnd.com/",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Douglas once served as a bustling railway hub with a thriving main street.",
