      ],
      "source": "https://www.douglasnd.com/",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Today, Douglas is a quiet little town with a serene atmosphere, making it a great place to live.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        24
